#: .\templates\public\careers.html:173
msgid ""
"A meaningful career is built through learning,\n"
"                    collaboration, and the opportunity to take on new\n"
"                    challenges. We believe in creating an environment\n"
"                    that encourages professional development."
msgstr ""
